---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Impact Calculator | Plastic & CO2e Avoided | Eco Happy"
  description="Four quick calculators estimating the plastic and CO2e avoided by switching pens, pencils, notebooks and corporate or event gift hampers to Eco Happy's plantable and upcycled versions, using published emission factors."
>
  <section class="container hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Honesty, not greenwashing</p>
    <h1>Estimate your impact</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Four quick calculators for switching everyday stationery and corporate or event gifting to plastic-free,
      plantable alternatives. Every number below comes from a published third-party source, applied to a
      typical product weight &mdash; these are estimates for illustration, not a measurement of your exact order.
      See <a href="#methodology">methodology &amp; sources</a> below.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container tools">
    <div class="tool card">
      <h2>1. Pens &amp; pencils swap</h2>
      <p class="tool-copy">How many pens or pencils does your team get through in a year?</p>
      <label class="field">
        <span>Pens/pencils per year</span>
        <input type="number" id="tool1-qty" min="0" value="500" step="10" />
      </label>
      <div class="result" id="tool1-result" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num" id="tool1-plastic">0</span><span class="stat-label">kg plastic avoided</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num" id="tool1-co2">0</span><span class="stat-label">kg CO2e avoided</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="tool-note">Assumes each conventional pen/pencil is ~10g of plastic, replaced with a newspaper or seed pencil that adds none.</p>
      <p class="tool-link"><a href="/blogs/what-are-sustainable-gifts-why-they-matter-more-than-ever/">Related: what makes a gift genuinely sustainable &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="tool card">
      <h2>2. Corporate bulk order</h2>
      <p class="tool-copy">How many seed pens or pencils are you ordering for a corporate gift run?</p>
      <label class="field">
        <span>Units in the order</span>
        <input type="number" id="tool2-qty" min="0" value="200" step="10" />
      </label>
      <div class="result" id="tool2-result" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num" id="tool2-plastic">0</span><span class="stat-label">kg plastic avoided</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num" id="tool2-co2">0</span><span class="stat-label">kg CO2e avoided</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num" id="tool2-seeds">0</span><span class="stat-label">seeds handed out</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="tool-note">Same plastic/CO2e assumption as above. "Seeds handed out" simply counts one embedded seed per unit, whether it gets planted is up to the recipient.</p>
      <p class="tool-link"><a href="/blogs/sustainable-stationery-for-luxury-resorts-across-the-globe/">Related: sustainable stationery for hospitality &amp; resorts &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="tool card">
      <h2>3. Notebooks &amp; diaries</h2>
      <p class="tool-copy">How many notebooks or diaries does your team use in a year?</p>
      <label class="field">
        <span>Notebooks/diaries per year</span>
        <input type="number" id="tool3-qty" min="0" value="100" step="5" />
      </label>
      <div class="result" id="tool3-result" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num" id="tool3-co2">0</span><span class="stat-label">kg CO2e avoided</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="tool-note">Assumes ~100g of paper per A5 notebook, comparing virgin-paper production against recycled/upcycled paper production.</p>
      <p class="tool-link"><a href="/blogs/how-small-businesses-can-reduce-their-carbon-footprint/">Related: cutting a small business's carbon footprint &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="tool card">
      <h2>4. Corporate &amp; event gift hampers</h2>
      <p class="tool-copy">Planning a hamper (pen/pencil + notebook + packaging) for a corporate event or client list?</p>
      <label class="field">
        <span>Hampers / recipients</span>
        <input type="number" id="tool4-qty" min="0" value="150" step="10" />
      </label>
      <div class="result" id="tool4-result" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num" id="tool4-plastic">0</span><span class="stat-label">kg plastic avoided</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num" id="tool4-co2">0</span><span class="stat-label">kg CO2e avoided</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="tool-note">Assumes one pen/pencil (~10g plastic) plus one A5 notebook (~100g paper) per hamper, using the same factors as tools 1 &amp; 3 combined.</p>
      <p class="tool-link"><a href="/blogs/embracing-sustainability-top-eco-friendly-corporate-gifting-trends-for-2025/">Related: corporate gifting trends for 2025 &rarr;</a> &middot; <a href="/gifting/corporate/">See corporate gifting</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container cta-strip">
    <p>Want these numbers for a real order?</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/919422062333" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask on WhatsApp</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/gifting/corporate/">See corporate gifting</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container methodology" id="methodology">
    <h2>Methodology &amp; sources</h2>
    <p>
      These calculators multiply a typical product weight by a published emissions factor. They are rough,
      illustrative estimates &mdash; not a certified carbon audit of your specific order &mdash; and none of the
      figures below are Eco Happy's own measured impact data (we don't publish invented numbers; see
      <a href="/about/">how Eco Happy works</a>).
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Plastic production footprint:</strong> ~2.5 kg CO2e per kg of plastic (cradle-to-gate), from the UK Government's 2021 GHG Conversion Factors for average plastic film, via <a href="https://www.climatiq.io/data/emission-factor/e8eed92f-6260-418f-ad53-32839143e48b" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Climatiq</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Paper production footprint:</strong> virgin paper ~1.0 kg CO2e/kg, recycled paper ~0.55 kg CO2e/kg, midpoints of the ranges published by <a href="https://ecohedge.com/data/factors/paper" target="_blank" rel="noopener">EcoHedge</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Typical pen weight:</strong> ~10g of plastic, based on a standard ballpoint pen (e.g. a BIC Cristal), per <a href="https://measuringly.com/how-much-does-pen-weigh/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">measuringly.com</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Typical notebook weight:</strong> ~100g of paper for a standard A5 notebook &mdash; our own rounded estimate for a ~100-page notebook, not a third-party figure.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="fine">Have better data for your specific products or order volumes? Tell us and we'll refine these assumptions.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const PLASTIC_CO2_PER_KG = 2.5;
  const PEN_PLASTIC_G = 10;
  const PAPER_VIRGIN_CO2_PER_KG = 1.0;
  const PAPER_RECYCLED_CO2_PER_KG = 0.55;
  const NOTEBOOK_PAPER_G = 100;

  function fmt(n) {
    return n.toLocaleString('en-IN', { maximumFractionDigits: 1 });
  }

  function bindTool1() {
    const qtyEl = document.getElementById('tool1-qty');
    const plasticEl = document.getElementById('tool1-plastic');
    const co2El = document.getElementById('tool1-co2');
    function update() {
      const qty = Math.max(0, Number(qtyEl.value) || 0);
      const plasticKg = (qty * PEN_PLASTIC_G) / 1000;
      const co2Kg = plasticKg * PLASTIC_CO2_PER_KG;
      plasticEl.textContent = fmt(plasticKg);
      co2El.textContent = fmt(co2Kg);
    }
    qtyEl.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  }

  function bindTool2() {
    const qtyEl = document.getElementById('tool2-qty');
    const plasticEl = document.getElementById('tool2-plastic');
    const co2El = document.getElementById('tool2-co2');
    const seedsEl = document.getElementById('tool2-seeds');
    function update() {
      const qty = Math.max(0, Number(qtyEl.value) || 0);
      const plasticKg = (qty * PEN_PLASTIC_G) / 1000;
      const co2Kg = plasticKg * PLASTIC_CO2_PER_KG;
      plasticEl.textContent = fmt(plasticKg);
      co2El.textContent = fmt(co2Kg);
      seedsEl.textContent = fmt(qty);
    }
    qtyEl.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  }

  function bindTool3() {
    const qtyEl = document.getElementById('tool3-qty');
    const co2El = document.getElementById('tool3-co2');
    function update() {
      const qty = Math.max(0, Number(qtyEl.value) || 0);
      const paperKg = (qty * NOTEBOOK_PAPER_G) / 1000;
      const co2Kg = paperKg * (PAPER_VIRGIN_CO2_PER_KG - PAPER_RECYCLED_CO2_PER_KG);
      co2El.textContent = fmt(co2Kg);
    }
    qtyEl.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  }

  function bindTool4() {
    const qtyEl = document.getElementById('tool4-qty');
    const plasticEl = document.getElementById('tool4-plastic');
    const co2El = document.getElementById('tool4-co2');
    function update() {
      const qty = Math.max(0, Number(qtyEl.value) || 0);
      const plasticKg = (qty * PEN_PLASTIC_G) / 1000;
      const plasticCo2 = plasticKg * PLASTIC_CO2_PER_KG;
      const paperKg = (qty * NOTEBOOK_PAPER_G) / 1000;
      const paperCo2 = paperKg * (PAPER_VIRGIN_CO2_PER_KG - PAPER_RECYCLED_CO2_PER_KG);
      plasticEl.textContent = fmt(plasticKg);
      co2El.textContent = fmt(plasticCo2 + paperCo2);
    }
    qtyEl.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  }

  bindTool1();
  bindTool2();
  bindTool3();
  bindTool4();
</script>

<style>
  .hero { max-width: 68ch; padding-block: 2rem 1rem; }
  .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--red-deep); }
  .lede { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--gray-500); }
  .lede a { color: var(--red-deep); }

  .tools { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; padding-block: 1rem 2.5rem; }
  .tool { padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--gray-200); }
  .tool h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.4em; }
  .tool-copy { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--gray-500); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .field { display: block; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .field span { display: block; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.4em; }
  .field input {
    width: 100%; padding: 0.6em 0.75em; border: 1px solid var(--gray-300); border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-size: 1rem; font-family: var(--font-body);
  }
  .field input:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ink); outline-offset: 1px; }
  .result { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; background: var(--cream); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .stat { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 90px; }
  .stat-num { display: block; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--red-deep); }
  .stat-label { display: block; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--gray-500); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .tool-note { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--gray-500); margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  .tool-link { font-size: 0.78rem; margin: 0; }
  .tool-link a { color: var(--forest); }

  .cta-strip { text-align: center; padding-block: 1rem 3rem; }
  .cta-strip p { font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .cta-row { display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }

  .methodology { max-width: 72ch; padding-block: 2rem 3.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-200); }
  .methodology h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .methodology ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .methodology li { margin-bottom: 0.6em; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--gray-500); }
  .methodology li strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .methodology .fine { font-size: 0.85rem; font-style: italic; }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .tools { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .tools { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
